---
manual: list_box.change
lines: [3211, 3215]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $picked = []
  @fruit = list_box items: ["Grapes", "Pears", "Apricots"]
  @fruit.change { $picked << @fruit.text }
end
----------- test code
assert_empty $picked

list_box.trigger_change("Pears")
list_box.trigger_change("Apricots")

assert_equal ["Pears", "Apricots"], $picked, "the change block runs whenever a new option is highlighted"
